This port changes session management, tool integration and state handling for
Golem's execution-only Bash tool. Clank's AI and human-workflow features are
not included.

Brush and Coreutils remain separate dependencies at the immutable revisions
recorded in Cargo.toml and Cargo.lock, under their respective licenses.
sed is uutils sed (https://github.com/uutils/sed, MIT) and jq's engine is jaq
(https://github.com/01mf02/jaq, MIT), used at the forked revisions recorded in Cargo.toml and
Cargo.lock under their respective licenses.

